  <file id="dialogs\characters\dun_lowlevelbunker4_ryl.txt" original="dialogs\characters\dun_lowlevelbunker4_ryl.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We are considering to settle around here for a while. Not sure if we are up to the place such as this one, though.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми розглядаємо можливість оселитися тут на деякий час. Не впевнений, чи ми готові до такого місця, як це. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>That green sofa right there. Ahh.. I can only imagine.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ось той зелений диван праворуч. Ахх... тільки уявити. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Hmm, how about... ah, I can't make up my mind.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Хмм, як щодо... ах, я не можу визначитися. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We were planning for so many adventures and now, it's all gone.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми планували стільки пригод, а тепер все скінчено. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I'll never forget what we've been through.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я ніколи не забуду те, через що ми пройшли. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We would've been toast without you. Thank you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми б загинули без тебе. Дякую. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We, ugh... I... I have failed.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми, ох... я... я зазнав невдачі. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Get ready. They're coming!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Будьте готові. Вони йдуть! &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>With or without you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">З вами чи без вас. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
